==============================================================================
A. T_0 .. T_(2^k - 1) is a complete residue system mod 2^k   (theorem 1)
   B. over a full period n mod 2^(k+1) every residue mod 2^k is hit exactly twice,
      and the two preimages are n and NOT(n) = 2^(k+1) - 1 - n            (fold)
==============================================================================
  k= 1  CRS on [0,2^k): True   every residue twice on [0,2^(k+1)): True   T_n = T_NOT(n): True
